<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-934] GridP2PContinuousDeploymentSelfTest.testDeployment() marshals GridLoadBalancerAdapter class</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-934</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;According to the contract of GridLoadBalancerAdapter it&apos;s prohibited to marshal this class. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, the test in the summary somehow marshals this class when OptimizedMarshaller is used. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Switching to PortableMarshaller will help to catch the issue (use GridPortableBasicTestSuite).&lt;/p&gt;

